145817076067", "locale": "ro_RO", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BombSquad", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Explodeaz\u0103-\u0163i prietenii (sau computerul) \u00eentr-un concurs de mini-jocuri explozive ca Captureaz\u0103 Steagul, Hockey-Bombist, \u015fi Meci-de-Moarte-\u00cen-Slow-Motion-Epic!\n\nBombele Afar\u0103!", "short_description": "Explodeaz\u0103-\u0163i prietenii (sau computerul) \u00eentr-un concurs de mini-jocuri explozive ca Captureaz\u0103 Steagul, Hockey-Bombist, \u015fi Meci-de-Moarte-\u00cen-Slow-Motion-Epic!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "620345225476457", "locale": "da_DK", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BombSquad VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Spr\u00e6ng dine venner eller computeren i luften i en turnering af eksplosive mini-spil som f.eks. find fanen, bombe-hockey og kamp til d\u00f8den i slowmotion.\n\nDer skydes!", "short_description": "Spr\u00e6ng dine venner eller computeren i luften i en turnering af eksplosive mini-spil som f.eks. find fanen, bombe-hockey og kamp til d\u00f8den i slowmotion."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "611092092953530", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BombSquad", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\uae43\ubc1c-\ud0c8\ud658, \ud3ed\ud0c4-\ud558\ud0a4, \uc5d0\ud53d-\uc2ac\ub85c-\ubaa8\uc158-\ub370\uc2a4-\ub9e4\uce58 \ub4f1\uc758 \ud3ed\ubc1c\uc131 \ubbf8\ub2c8 \uac8c\uc784 \ud1a0\ub108\uba3c\ud2b8\uc5d0\uc11c \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4 (\ub610\ub294 \ucef4\ud4e8\ud130)\uc744 \ub0a0\ub824\ubc84\ub9ac\uc138\uc694!", "short_description": "\uae43\ubc1c-\ud0c8\ud658, \ud3ed\ud0c4-\ud558\ud0a4, \uc5d0\ud53d-\uc2ac\ub85c-\ubaa8\uc158-\ub370\uc2a4-\ub9e4\uce58 \ub4f1\uc758 \ud3ed\ubc1c\uc131 \ubbf8\ub2c8 \uac8c\uc784 \ud1a0\ub108\uba3c\ud2b8\uc5d0\uc11c \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4 (\ub610\ub294 \ucef4\ud4e8\ud130)\uc744 \ub0a0\ub824\ubc84\ub9ac\uc138\uc694!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "589766938288616", "locale": "cs_CZ", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BombSquad", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Vyho\u010fte do vzduchu sv\u00e9 p\u0159\u00e1tele (nebo po\u010d\u00edta\u010d) v turnaji explozivn\u00edch miniher jako je t\u0159eba Seber Vlajku, Bomber-Hokej, a Epick\u00fd-Slow-Motion-Z\u00e1pas-Smrti!\n\nOdho\u010fte Bomby", "short_description": "Vyho\u010fte do vzduchu sv\u00e9 p\u0159\u00e1tele (nebo po\u010d\u00edta\u010d) v turnaji explozivn\u00edch miniher jako je t\u0159eba Seber Vlajku, Bomber-Hokej, a Epick\u00fd-Slow-Motion-Z\u00e1pas-Smrti!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "571200583496276", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BombSquad", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Zeige es deinen Freunden (oder dem Computer) in einem Turnier explosiver Minispiele, wie beispielsweise Fahne erobern, Bomben-Hockey und Epik-Zeitlupen-Deathmatch!\n\nBomb sie alle weg!", "short_description": "Zeige es deinen Freunden (oder dem Computer) in einem Turnier explosiver Minispiele, wie beispielsweise Fahne erobern, Bomben-Hockey und Epik-Zeitlupen-Deathmatch!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "531496974429872", "locale": "sv_SE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BombSquad", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Spr\u00e4ng dina v\u00e4nner (eller datorn) i en turnering av exposiva minispel s\u00e5 som F\u00e5nga flaggan, Bombarhockey och Episk-Slowmotion-Death-Match!\n\nL\u00e5t bomberna regna!", "short_description": "Spr\u00e4ng dina v\u00e4nner (eller datorn) i en turnering av exposiva minispel s\u00e5 som F\u00e5nga flaggan, Bombarhockey och Episk-Slowmotion-Death-Match!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "517505362530472", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": n